    "case_for": "Optical lattice clocks turn atomic physics into an exceptionally precise and reproducible measurement of time. Their performance enables tests of fundamental physics and relativistic effects, and the method has been refined and demonstrated across laboratories over decades. Katori and Ye made complementary foundational contributions, making this a mature achievement with a clear experimental core.",
